    gmeow:saRationale "The explicit inventory MUST equal the slice-owned typed term set exactly, and every member MUST retain an RDF declaration kind, the logic slice owner, and a valid graph-box role. This catches undeclared, unowned, unboxed, omitted, and silently added terms in one closed structural matrix while naming every term for testing-reach coverage." .
